  "limits": "The retail context block is produced by `rep movsd` from a stack temporary whose dwords 1 and 5 are never initialized (disassembly 0x004C671E-0x004C6755 and 0x004C6798-0x004C67D0); the emulator's freshly mapped stack is zero, so those two dwords do not distinguish a reconstruction that writes zero (the documented port behaviour) from one that copies the same residue. The retail group index is not bounds checked; every case here uses an index inside the ported table so the port's documented clamping is not exercised.",
